("clftoctkc03rpmkeskdy7cx1h","Старый дом","Altes Haus","Altes Haus (translating to Old House), built in 1368, is arguably the oldest building in Bacharach. With its half-timbered structure, turrets, and gables, this house truly befits fairy tales. It houses a restaurant that has a limited menu but enjoys immense popularity thanks to its heritage and historic ambiance. The owners will be happy to show you old photographs that document how everything in the city except the Altes Haus has changed over the centuries. Be prepared for it to be quite busy, especially during high season.","Oberstraße 61, 55422 Bacharach, Germany",50.0603326,7.7680448,0,0,NULL,"2953702",3488),
